  "description": "Cockpit component for managing libvirt virtual machines.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* cockpit-machines: cockpit-machines: Sensitive data exposure via command-line arguments (CVE-2026-92768)\n\n* cockpit-machines: cockpit-machines: Sensitive Data Exposure of guest credentials via JSON argument in process list (CVE-2026-92747)\n\n* cockpit-machines: cockpit-machines: Information Disclosure of RHSM Offline Token via Process Arguments (CVE-2026-92745)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
